# description: Create a custom page preview token (zone)
POST /client/v4/zones/9f1839b6152d298aca64c4e906b6d074/custom_pages/preview_tokens HTTP/1.1
Host: api.cloudflare.com
Authorization: Bearer opf_cloudflare_EXAMPLE
Content-Type: application/json

{"act":"preview","target":"block:waf","url":"https://example.com/error.html"}